sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy
    participant EPP as Endpoint Picker (EPP)<br/>gRPC ExtProc<br/>Optional TLS
    participant Parser as Protocol Parser<br/>OpenAI/Anthropic/<br/>vLLM/Vertex AI
    participant FC as Flow Control<br/>Priority Bands
    participant Sched as Scheduler<br/>Filter/Score/Pick
    participant DL as Data Layer<br/>Metrics + Attributes
    participant Backend as Inference Backend<br/>(Model Server Pod)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    Note over Client,Backend: Inference Request Flow (via Envoy ExtProc)

    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>or /v1/completions
    Envoy->>EPP: gRPC ExtProc callout<br/>ProcessingRequest (request_headers)

    EPP->>Parser: Decode request protocol
    Parser-->>EPP: Parsed model name, parameters

    EPP->>FC: Check admission<br/>InferenceObjective priority bands
    FC-->>EPP: Admitted / Queued / Rejected

    EPP->>DL: Fetch endpoint attributes
    DL-->>EPP: Concurrency, GPU util,<br/>latency, prefix cache state

    EPP->>Sched: Select endpoint<br/>(filter → score → pick)
    Sched-->>EPP: Selected endpoint address

    EPP-->>Envoy: ProcessingResponse<br/>(route to selected endpoint)
    Envoy->>Backend: Forward inference request
    Backend-->>Envoy: Inference response
    Envoy-->>Client: HTTP response

    Note over EPP,OTel: Observability (async)
    EPP-)OTel: Export traces<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    Note over Client,Backend: Coordinator HTTP Gateway Flow (Direct)

    Client->>EPP: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP (Coordinator Server)
    EPP->>Backend: Route to selected endpoint
    Backend-->>EPP: Inference response
    EPP-->>Client: HTTP response

    Note over EPP,K8sAPI: Controller Reconciliation (Background)

    K8sAPI->>EPP: Watch: InferenceModelRewrite<br/>InferenceObjective<br/>InferencePool, Pod
    EPP->>EPP: Reconcile CRDs<br/>Update datastore,<br/>flow control config

    Note over EPP,K8sAPI: Health Probes

    Client->>EPP: GET /healthz or /readyz<br/>(HTTP - Coordinator)
    EPP-->>Client: 200 OK

    Client->>EPP: gRPC Health.Check<br/>(EPP Health Service)
    EPP-->>Client: SERVING / NOT_SERVING
